    <comp lib="0" loc="(56,43)" name="Text">
      <a name="text">pulse generator - This outputs a "0" normally, with regularly spaced bursts of "1" ouputs.
The period (the amount of time between clicks, in hundredths of a second) is controlled by an
input, and the duration of the pulse is controlled by a second input. The duration
is specified as a number from 0 to 65535, corresponding to a maximum of 4 seconds pulse.
This also outputs the "sweep" number, counting from 0 up to Duty, during each pulse.</a>
    </comp>
